? Bot1.Battlefield.Sphinx of False Conclusions.Toughness = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sphinx of False Conclusions.Keywords = Flash; Flying
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sphinx of False Conclusions)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
